#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\features\audio.py:300
msgid "Uploading..."
msgstr "Відвантаження..."

#. Translators: Progress message spoken when the add-on starts taking a screenshot of the current focused object.
#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\features\audio.py:326
#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\features\operator_captcha.py:733
#: addon\globalPlugins\visionAssistant\features\vision.py:1761
